@page "/orderer"

<PageTitle>주문 홈 · 살뜰</PageTitle>

<main class="orderer-discovery" aria-labelledby="orderer-discovery-title">
    <div class="orderer-discovery__topbar">
        <span>주문 홈</span>
        <span>살뜰 주문자 · 체험</span>
    </div>

    <header class="orderer-discovery__hero">
        <div>
            <span>내 주변과 지역</span>
            <a href="information/regional-products">설정</a>
        </div>
        <h1 id="orderer-discovery-title">무엇을 주문해볼까요?</h1>
        <p>문화·산지 이야기 또는 근처 음식점에서 시작하세요.</p>
        <div class="orderer-discovery__scope">
            <strong>문화상품</strong>
            <span>근처 매장</span>
        </div>
    </header>

    <nav class="orderer-discovery__filters" aria-label="주문 추천 필터">
        <a class="is-active" href="orderer">추천</a>
        <a href="information/regional-products">문화</a>
        <a href="orderer/mart">근처 음식점</a>
    </nav>

    <section class="orderer-discovery__products" aria-label="주문 탐색 예시">
        @foreach (var item in Products)
        {
            <article class="orderer-product">
                <div class="orderer-product__badges">
                    <span class="@($"orderer-product__kind orderer-product__kind--{item.Tone}")">@item.Kind</span>
                    <span class="orderer-product__when">@item.When</span>
                </div>
                <h2>@item.Title</h2>
                <p>@item.Description</p>
                <div class="orderer-product__price">
                    <strong>@item.Price</strong>
                    <span>@item.Delivery</span>
                </div>
                <div class="orderer-product__progress" aria-label="@($"{item.Progress}% 준비")">
                    <i style="@($"width:{item.Progress}%")"></i>
                </div>
                <div class="orderer-product__action">
                    <span>@item.Hint</span>
                    <a href="@item.Href">@item.Action <b>›</b></a>
                </div>
            </article>
        }
    </section>

    <section class="orderer-discovery__boundary">
        <strong>먼저 상품을 보고, 주문 방식은 나중에</strong>
        <p>개별 주문이 기본입니다. 시간이 여유롭고 비용을 줄이고 싶을 때만 같이 주문을 비교합니다.</p>
    </section>

    <nav class="orderer-discovery__next" aria-label="주문자 다음 단계">
        <a href="information/kamis-domestic-price-comparison">KAMIS 가격 확인</a>
        <a href="orderer/group-import/fcl-goal">FCL 공동목표</a>
        <a href="orderer/workspace">전체 업무 보기</a>
    </nav>
</main>

